"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの動画を見ながらうるうるしているまあやより"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調崩してないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみんなが笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントや755で応援してくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までよりもっと成長した姿を見せるから！ついてこいよっ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとずっと夢だったアンダーライブがついに武道館LIVE決定しました！！！！\nほんとに嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/01/8112060/0020.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-48584":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"      年末です！2018年も終わりです！伊藤純奈です！  "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9RG51TFW2PK49CF0HV9RS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   まずお知らせ！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9RHASW5P2J6W8GX2K286R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> 週間プレイボーイ発売中です！        今年も1年間舞台をはじめとして、色々な活動をさせて頂きました！主演をさせて頂いたのが1番大きかったかなあ。 あと大事なメンバー達の卒業も大きいです！それぞれのところで活動してるのがみれてほんとにほんとにうれしい☺︎ 乃木坂46としてもまた大きいグループになったと思います。レコード大賞を今年も頂けたこと、グループの一員としてとても光栄です！ そしてまた紅白歌合戦に今年も出演させて頂きます！幸せだ〜みなさんおたのしみに(〃ω〃)     今年も本当にみなさんにたくさん支えて頂きました。たくさんの感謝を！！ありがとうございます！！！  "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9RJCC2N76A6Q93J27FH05","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">  来年もよろしくお願いします〜！！        それでは！    "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-31560":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中グアム最終回でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14thヒット祈願のスカイダイビング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと...私がさせていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ゲーム負けたぁぁ（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛ぶ瞬間ほんとに恐怖で機体にしがみついたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有無を言わさずおとされたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おちてる間は溺れてる感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒット祈願口で言おうと思ったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"息が吸えませんでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パラシュート開いたあとも生存してることにホッとしすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭真っ白に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おゆるしを〜>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶景には大感動。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生で経験できてよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの思いをのせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事とべて一安心です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、14thシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大ヒットしますようにっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/04/04/3990227/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑とぶ前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/04/04/3990227/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑とんだ後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風圧により？顔がすっきりしたよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが励ましてくれてすごく心強かったーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてスカイダイビングのあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキューバダイビングへ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日に天から落ちて海底まで沈みました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの部屋はさゆりんとペアでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも負け続けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアム旅最初から最後までずっと同じ行動だったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがからあげ姉妹や〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録のときもつけてた髪飾りのお花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はさゆりんとおそろで買ったんだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴重なバナナマンさんとのグアムロケ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして自由時間も含め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実してすっごく楽しかったぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかまたいきたいっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra