,{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木どこ\n成人メンバーでますよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-26119":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中の、UTBさんの\nオフショットです( *´ヮ`* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルらしいポーズや表情は\n一切なく、自然体な中での\n写真を撮って頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラマンさんは、松井玲奈さんの\nファースト写真集「きんぎょ｣を\n撮った 丸谷嘉長さん。\nとっても勉強になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表現者としての私。素の私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん、ぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台「じょしらく｣で演出を\nしてくださった川尻さん、\n音楽を担当してくださった\nあらいさんが手掛けた舞台、\n「青春鉄道｣を観てきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても面白かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに人を笑顔にさせる\nものづくりが出来るってすごいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく笑いの余韻が残ってます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六義園のライトアップを\n見てきました( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間が空けばどこへでもフラっと\n一人で出掛けるのが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六義園は、都内でも一番好きな\n庭園で、どの季節も素晴らしいので\nもう何度も行っています(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこうやって、紅葉の時期に\nゆっくり夜のライトアップを\n見に行けるのは、初めてでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだちょこっと色づき始めでしたが\n十分、綺麗でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼間とはまた全然違って、\n幻想的な美しさがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中のお茶屋さんで、三福だんごの\n醤油を買い、もぐもぐしながら\nゆっくり見て回りました。\nめちゃめちゃ美味しかったです。\n今度はくるみ味噌も食べてみたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節って当たり前に過ぎていくけど、\n四季があるって、本当に\n素敵だなあって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんなじ景色でも、\n見るたびに表情が違うのが\n面白いし、好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは西洋の庭園では見られない、\n日本だからこそ生み出せる美しさですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全てが左右対称の西洋もすごく素敵だけど、\n遠近感や奥行感を持たせて\n大自然の中にある美しさを活かし、\n季節や見方によって千変万化する\n日本の庭園も本当に素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こんな風に『当たり前』に\n毎年訪れる季節の流れを\nちゃんと『大切』にする、\nその思いも好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅葉、できればもっと遠くまで\n色んなとこに行って見たいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/24/5593292/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6108":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"７月20日ゆったん、\n７月23日ろってぃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつもありがとね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きよー‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すてきな一年になりますように´っω･*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろうそくの火を吹き消すゆったんと\n満面の笑みのゆったん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキに喜んで飛びはねてカメラに写らないろってぃーと\nケーキと一緒に笑顔のろってぃー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも可愛いなーーヽ(^0^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきよすきよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え⁇ケーキはものの３分でなくなりましたよ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戦場でしたよ⁇(*´艸`)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服の感想ありがとう(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好評みたいでよかったよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今日は前回のイメージとは\n全く違う私服で\n昨日は過ごしてたよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バットマンＴシャツに\nデニムスカートとゆーー\nシンプルスタイル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｔシャツに一目惚れしちゃって(*/ｪ＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もまた感想教えてくださいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問の答えありがとーう＊‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪人気だったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかった安心♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶髪もいいけどまだまだ先だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の質問っ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝はパン派⁇ご飯派⁇べつのもの派⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにちはるはパン派ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はじゃこチーズトーストだったよ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外とおいしーの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久しぶりに朝のこの時間帯に更新ーーーつーつー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は通学じゃなくて通勤か⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆことで今日はまだ内緒のお仕事があるんよ＼(^^)／ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーけーなったら報告しますね‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/6933769/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってきますヽ(^0^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪(o・ω・)ノ))"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-14023":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんちゃんわ〜ん(*´ω｀*)\nRottyだお。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/09/2414066/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はねっ朝早くから\n生写真の撮影やったよ(*^^*)\n色んなお洋服着て撮ったから\nお楽しみにねん\\(*^^*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと昨日は\n高校の卒業アルバムの写真を\n撮った記念すべき日でもある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってからは\n久しぶりに渋谷へ行けました〜(о´∀`о)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は 仕事が増え収録やったり\nリハーサルやライブあったりで\n割と忙しかったんで\n久々にせちゃんとも\nカラオケに行けました☆！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急にめっちゃ雨降りだして\nせっちゃんとろってぃ-\n「やばいやばいwww」\n「やばいてw(;゜∇゜)」\n言いながら 二人でずぶ濡れになりながら\n傘買いに行って\nどうにかこうにか避難しました(>▽<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は ゆっくりデートしてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん好きやぁ〜\n流行りでいうバイブスってやつ(/*▽*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テルマエ・ロマエと。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/09/2414066/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんは世界いち。\nちーちゃんの-ちーちゃんのっ♪、\nちーちゃんの 膝小僧。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝小僧と言えば あにあにだよ。\nまあ、この話しはいつか流れる乃木ここで... 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流れなかったら またblogで\nお話しするぅ〜(о´∀`о)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは 青森で食べた\nお寿司さんだああよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/09/2414066/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーはん。\nおいちかったぁ〜 ( 〃▽〃)\nほっぺた おちんで 本間に ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司食べーの\nこの後に 唐揚げとか\nサイドメニューも色々頂いてさ...\n本当 自分らよく食べるよ♪あは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は  新宿に行ってきました ！\n実は プライベートでは\n数える程度しか行ったことなくて\n『さあ〜 ろってぃちゃん！\nここはどぉーこだ？？？』\nってなってた。))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"道に迷ってウロチョロしてる\nRottyを見かけた人\nいるんぢゃないかーと。(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートと言っても\n健康診断をしにです...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本間は 畠中のせーらと\n行く予定やってんけど\nせーら風邪ひいたみたい。早く元気になってね\n(´・з・)ぶちゅ。\nちゅー。\nちゅーしゃ打っちゃうぞ(/*・ω・)/！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで今日も皆が大好き\nあのドーナッツ屋さん♪へ\n行くんだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃあ まったねーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 好きやでぇ〜(( 〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし"}],"source":"archive"}}